{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>airosphere 是一款極簡風格呼吸練習 App，適合想減壓、提升專注力或尋找平靜的人。有別於只提供固定節奏的呼吸工具，它讓使用者自行設定吸氣、閉氣與呼氣時間，配合觸覺震動引導及 100 種配色組合，建立完全個人化的練習流程。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-76.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂節奏與觸覺震動引導</h2>\n<p>內建 Box Breathing、4-7-8、生理嘆息與 Coherent Breathing 等精選模式，亦可自行設定吸氣、閉氣與呼氣時間至毫秒，配合個人肺容量。精準觸覺回饋讓使用者閉眼只憑震動完成練習，10 種上下配色可組出 100 種漸變組合。程式設有安全上限與指引，避免過度換氣，並原生支援深色模式。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-498-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-499-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-500-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-501-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-502-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-503-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：airosphere: breathe your way</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/airosphere-breathe-your-way/id6758896883?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T21:40:13.856841+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T21:32:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T00:18:13.886464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T21:38:06.803017+00:00","content_hash":"92a853f28bfd1ee793c6829f8312adb60eb8eccc992651228038006eda3dee9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}